+| DeepSeek | — | — | [DeepSeek API 模型](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing) | [DeepSeek Chat](https://chat.deepseek.com/) / [DeepSeek Tool Calls](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing) |
